cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset or code, please cite the paper below.
title: Structured evaluation with rule-based verification for LLM annotation of gold-standard datasets — data and code
abstract: >-
  Elicitations, gold labels, rule sets and a deterministic verifier for a structured
  LLM annotation method that decomposes a label into a hierarchy of granularities,
  declares the relations among them as logical rules, evaluates each granularity in
  a mutually blind pass, and applies those rules at no model cost.
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Ghang
    affiliation: Yonsei University
    email: glee@yonsei.ac.kr
license: MIT
keywords:
  - gold-standard annotation
  - large language models
  - LLM-as-judge
  - task decomposition
  - BIM checkability
  - automated design compliance checking
